#####=== Rust ===#####

# Cargo build artefacts. These must never be committed: `target/` bakes
# absolute paths into the test binaries (`CARGO_BIN_EXE_ulid`), so a committed
# copy makes `cargo test` fail on every machine except the one that wrote it.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Coverage output
/coverage/
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info

#####=== OS ===#####
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

#####=== Migration deliverables ===#####

# These describe the migration rather than perform it, and ship alongside the
# repository rather than inside it. truth.md cites the migration commit by SHA,
# which cannot exist until after that commit is made — so they are kept out of
# the tree deliberately, not by oversight.
/truth.md
/instructions.md
/golden.patch
/fix.patch
/test.patch
